DEFECT LEFT IN PLACE (outside this module)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/helpers.js:721 — validateInteger(n) takes no message argument and returns a boolean
instead of throwing, unlike every other validateX in the family. Its other caller,
$$.randomInteger (src/vUX-core-4.0.0-beta.js:1124), passes it a message and ignores the
result, so those two argument checks are also no-ops. Not changed here: the signature is
shared and correcting it is a core change that wants its own feature entry.

