VERIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
No test runner exists in this repository, so the module was exercised directly: the core
import was stripped, window.$$, the validateX family, processAssetPath and vModel were
stubbed to the semantics in src/helpers.js, and a minimal DOM (element and text nodes,
lastChild/removeChild/nextElementSibling, class list, HTML serialisation) was supplied.
setTimeout was wrapped to reproduce the browser's string coercion of a non-function
handler rather than Node's throw. Every defect above was measured on the old file and
re-measured on the new one; 26 assertions covering all ten changes, plus the behaviour
that already worked (plain typing, '|' line breaks, callback delivery), pass.
